guide forever-dungeon-quests/shadowfang-keep-alliance
title Shadowfang Keep (Alliance)
category Dungeons
folder Shadowfang Keep
faction Alliance
class Rogue, Warrior
levels 20-30
zone Ashenvale
keywords Shadowfang Keep, Silverpine Forest, Pyrewood, Dead Drop, Horn of Xelthos, Alonso, Dragonslayer's Helm, Rogue, Warrior, Arugal, dungeon
why The Alliance's quests in Shadowfang Keep are class quests: the Rogues' and the Warriors' in one run.

# Shadowfang Keep's Alliance quests are class quests, so this guide is only
# for Rogues and Warriors: the Dead Drop's 78261 The Horn of Xelthos (from the
# Ornamented Chest inside) and Alonso's 78132 Dragonslayer's Helm (the
# Discarded Helm inside).
#
# Left out: the Paladins' 1654 and 1806 The Test of Righteousness (they need
# the Deadmines' lumber); the Warlocks' 1740 The Orb of Soran'ruk (its
# fragments come from Blackfathom Deeps); 78307, the Horn of Xelthos'
# follow-up, which has no giver in the data.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the chest or the helm inside, so their
# goals stand at the door (@44.8,67.8, Silverpine Forest). Shadowfang Keep is
# in Horde land.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Horn of Xelthos' text asks you to do the
#   job alone.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size and levels: the client's group finder, as Polestar's
#   Codex page holds it (five players, levels 20 to 30).
# INGAME: where inside do the Ornamented Chest and the Discarded Helm stand?

step Alonso
  only Warrior
  accept 78132

step The Dead Drop
  only Rogue
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Near Pyrewood Village, in Horde land.
  accept 78261

step To Shadowfang Keep
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 20 to 30, in Horde land.
  enter "Shadowfang Keep" @44.8,67.8

step Class quests
  tip Rogues: the Horn of Xelthos is in an Ornamented Chest; its quest asks you to do the job alone, so in a group it may not count. Warriors: the Dragonslayer's Helm is a Discarded Helm in the keep.
  collect 210183 quest 78261.1 @44.8,67.8 only Rogue
  collect 209872 quest 78132.1 @44.8,67.8 group 5 only Warrior

step The Dead Drop
  only Rogue
  turnin 78261

step Alonso
  only Warrior
  zone Ashenvale
  turnin 78132
